@ref Sch 3 (src:7769-7783)
GIVEN convention IS A `sch 3 convention`
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`sch 3 the Gazette number of the convention` MEANS
    CONSIDER convention
    WHEN `sch 3 item 1 the convention between the United Kingdom and Austria` THEN JUST "T 2/1999"
    WHEN `sch 3 item 2 the convention between the United Kingdom and Italy` THEN JUST "T 3/1999"
    WHEN `sch 3 item 3 the convention between the United Kingdom and Germany` THEN JUST "T 4/1999"
    WHEN `sch 3 item 4 the treaty between Singapore and the People's Republic of China` THEN JUST "T 2/2001"
    WHEN `sch 3 item 5 the Hague Service Convention of 15 November 1965` THEN JUST "T 1/2023"
    WHEN `sch 3 another instrument` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Third Schedule lists five instruments; any other instrument has no entry

